WEBVTT

00:00:03.186 --> 00:00:05.279
Click a booking to open it.

00:00:05.279 --> 00:00:10.099
It shows its status, the buyer, what was booked, the price, the order,

00:00:10.099 --> 00:00:12.256
and each traveler's details.

00:00:12.710 --> 00:00:16.863
A paid booking is Confirmed, and the buyer gets an email.

00:00:16.863 --> 00:00:21.610
After the date, mark it Complete, or No-show if they did not come.

00:00:22.062 --> 00:00:26.240
Cancel shows how many days before the date it is, what the policy

00:00:26.240 --> 00:00:29.242
keeps, and what is refunded of what was paid.

00:00:29.696 --> 00:00:33.563
Change the Refund to give back more or less, add a Reason, and

00:00:33.563 --> 00:00:35.326
click Cancel the booking.

00:00:35.326 --> 00:00:39.022
The money goes back to how they paid, what is still owed is

00:00:39.022 --> 00:00:42.776
let go, the date is free again, and the buyer gets an email.

